    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d299-a1">

                <pb facs="0312" n="306" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg306"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Madriz to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-07-10"><hi rendition="#italic">July 10,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>General Cabezas reports rising in Mosquito with participation of Americans.
                    Government will act energetically. Endeavor to impede arrival of aid from United
                    States and notify that rebels will be treated according to laws of war.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
